Here's a MATLAB code that converts a given phrase to its Morse Code representation using the provided Morse Code table:

```matlab
function morse_code = convert_to_morse(phrase)
    % Convert the input phrase to uppercase
    phrase = upper(phrase);

    % Initialize an empty string to store the Morse Code representation
    morse_code = '';

    % Loop through each character in the input phrase
    for i = 1:length(phrase)
        % Get the Morse Code representation of the current character
        morse_code_char = lookup(phrase(i), 'Morse Code');

        % Add the Morse Code representation of the current character to the output string
        morse_code = [morse_code, morse_code_char];
    end
end
```

To use this function, simply call it with your input phrase as an argument:

